<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.label.reads ~ face ~ the one line the host asks the vessel

`lares surface face` answers the face the house resolves (the worn face, or `--face N`) and its pet name, as `h<N> <pet name>`. The host shim asks this line only for a face no label settles.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ worn

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`worn` params=`~ name the worn face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads face labels, asking the vessel where none settles; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · surface-face-unnamed · surface-face-unanswered

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.label.reads]] ~ a malformed --face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-face-unnamed` params=`~ no face label settles the face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-face-unanswered` params=`~ the vessel answered no face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`face` params=`exit/0 fields/[[face petname]] ~ the face index and its pet name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

